# Text files are stored and checked out with LF on every OS, so rustfmt
# and byte-exact tests see the same bytes on Linux and Windows.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Save fixtures and test data are compared byte for byte: a PR save
# carries a BOM and a trailing CRLF that no checkout may rewrite.
fixtures/** -text
crates/*/tests/data/** -text
*.sav -text

# Images and other binary assets.
*.png binary
*.ico binary
